Two places need edits.

**1. `DLUTR`**: replace the `GoSub(Debtor-lookup,s,1)` line with these two, right after the `Playback`:

```
  same => n,Gosub(NoLookup-check,s,1)
  same => n,GosubIf($["${NOLOOKUP}"!="1"]?Debtor-lookup,s,1)	; Skip lookup for no-lookup list
```

**2. `status-open`**: add one line after the `ExecIf ... Background(${recording})` line and before `GoSub(Debtor-lookup,s,1)`:

```
  same => n,GotoIf($["${NOLOOKUP}"="1"]?directdial,s,1)		; On no-lookup list, skip lookup, dial ZULU
```

Paste `[NoLookup-check]` anywhere at the top level of the file, outside any other context.
